        <tr id="comment-body-445311"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL242136https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL242136at26%2FMar%2F255%3A15PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-42136" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-42136</a> at 26/Mar/25 5:15 PM</h5>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/347304" alt="36d5bc367d490befbd3f8d1e4b0bc72-20250326-091511.jpg" height="711" width="1824" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>从上面集群的创建时间对比 eks 虚机使用的镜像的创建时间，发现是早于镜像创建时间的，因此判断是由于原来的镜像被删除了，导致扩容失败。</p>
        </td></tr>
