        <tr id="comment-body-445569"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>客户环境里这个镜像是pending_deleted状态，是软删除的，ceph中的镜像文件还在（location还在）。glance是604版本，此版本不支持通过命令或api恢复pending_deleted镜像。经产品线评估，通过mysql命令直接修改数据库（涉及3张表），具体命令请参考下面的示例。</p>

<p><a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A75e29dcd-6a75-496d-8c75-639443807917" class="user-hover" rel="557058:75e29dcd-6a75-496d-8c75-639443807917" data-account-id="557058:75e29dcd-6a75-496d-8c75-639443807917" accountid="557058:75e29dcd-6a75-496d-8c75-639443807917" rel="noreferrer">李向军</a> <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5e44fa3fa17f930c9b944948" class="user-hover" rel="5e44fa3fa17f930c9b944948" data-account-id="5e44fa3fa17f930c9b944948" accountid="5e44fa3fa17f930c9b944948" rel="noreferrer">朱永安</a> <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5e60d2616e8fdd0cd8174a3e" class="user-hover" rel="5e60d2616e8fdd0cd8174a3e" data-account-id="5e60d2616e8fdd0cd8174a3e" accountid="5e60d2616e8fdd0cd8174a3e" rel="noreferrer">楚伟</a> FYI</p>

